Thoron: its own version ("0.1.1") wherever a person sees a version.

chrome/VERSION carries THORON_VERSION next to the build number (tools/release/version.py in the Thoron
repository). The About page, chrome://version, chrome://flags, the Windows list of apps (DisplayVersion) and
the product version of the files show it. The four-part build number stays as it is everywhere else:
websites, extensions, the installer and the updater compare that one.

Origin: Thoron
Author: KuchiSofts
License: BSD-3-Clause

